WEBVTT

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:28.190
<i>Jean and Nadia are living comfortably with the others</i>

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:29.650
<i>on a desert island.</i>

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:32.070
<i>But there will always be trouble</i>

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.690
<i>when more than two people gather together.</i>

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:38.490
<i>Jean and Nadia discover an underground world.</i>

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:41.410
<i>And when her Blue Water begins to glow suddenly,</i>

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.160
<i>Nadia is swallowed by a wall while Jean watches helplessly.</i>

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:49.630
<i>The secret of Blue Water shall now be revealed.</i>

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:03.260
Hanson, do that later!

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.850
Help me now!

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:05.980
Just a minute, okay?

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.230
Don't mess with that!

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:15.150
Let's fix this quickly and get off of this island!

00:02:15.610 --> 00:02:17.360
All right already.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.080
You've fixed the balloon so quickly.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.290
Thank you, Marie!

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:33.420
You too, King! Thank you!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.220
It looks like Nadia is pretty late.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:47.480
It's funny that they got lost in the forest.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.390
Jean doesn't talk much either.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.150
Funny indeed.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.900
What do you mean?

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.980
You think Jean is a pervert like you?

00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:00.910
No! I'm talking about the forest where they went.

00:03:01.490 --> 00:03:02.780
Come to think of it,

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:05.990
there was something strange at the mountain yesterday.

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:10.370
I'm afraid there's some secret on this island.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.420
I see.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.500
But why doesn't Jean tell us anything?

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:19.010
I suppose it's something he can't tell anybody.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.850
Okay!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.430
I'll go and see what Jean's doing.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:29.020
Oh, no! I think you should just leave him alone.

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:32.230
Don't worry. I'll just cheer him up.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:39.110
Hi, Jean!

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.410
What happened? Cheer up!

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.410
Nadia will come back, I'm sure.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.120
I know you're worried, but you'll see.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.880
Sanson...

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.460
Do you know where she is?

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.670
Right then! Let's go find her!

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:16.110
Where am I?

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:19.440
This is the satellite city Red Noah.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:20.940
Red Noah?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:26.160
Welcome, legitimate successor of the Toris Megistos,

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.280
Princess Nadia.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.990
Me?

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:33.500
We have been waiting for you to come here,

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:37.750
so that we might hand down to you the history of Atlantis.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:39.210
Who are you?

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.130
Creations of the inhabitants of the M78 Nebula.

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:48.430
The inhabitants of the M78 Nebula?

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:22.340
The M78 Nebula is 277.5 light-years from this system.

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.260
The people of Atlantis

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:31.100
made an emergency landing on Earth 2,400,000 years ago.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.480
The Atlanteans were forced to live on Earth

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:44.070
for they had no way to return to their own star.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.030
They created as powerful a civilization as possible.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:53.330
They did this to banish the darkness of this world.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:58.960
But they made a silly mistake.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:07.090
They used their advanced technology in holy wars.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:11.510
As a result, all the cities were desolated.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:15.810
After that, the few people of Atlantis left alive

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:20.100
built another civilization on the continent of Pangaea.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:24.780
Once again, that civilization was destroyed by war.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.740
You have the power of the Toris Megistos.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.250
Toris Megistos?

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:41.500
The Blue Water was called the Philosopher's Stone.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:45.760
Does this stone have such terrible power?

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.470
That I cannot say.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.010
The rightful possessor of the Toris Megistos

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.640
can be either God or the Devil,

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.560
and will know the beginning of life.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:01.730
You mean I have inherited this power?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:05.820
Yes, you are not a human being.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:11.990
You are the heir of the M78 Nebula's Atlantean dynasty.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:15.950
I'm an Atlantean.

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.620
Not a human being?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:21.920
Be careful.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.580
Come back quickly.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:24.840
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:28.970
Never mind that! You're the only one who can help Nadia.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.300
Thanks, everybody!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.300
Good luck!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:42.560
Shall we pack up before Jean and Nadia come back?

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.730
That's funny. There's no wind.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.730
Wind?

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.610
No insects and no birds either.

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.610
There are also no mosquitoes today.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.910
It's coming!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:11.630
Just what's going on these days?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:17.510
Please excuse me! I didn't mean to...

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.530
Senorita, look! There!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:31.610
What is it?

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.700
What's this?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:39.200
The hillside slid into the sea? Impossible!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.710
No, I'm sure this is the beginning of it all.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.750
What a terrible earthquake! How is everybody?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.800
I was right. This island is a huge ship made by someone.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.270
What? What's going to happen?

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:04.310
A control device has been activated.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.520
A control device?

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:11.030
Red Noah has been waiting for you to arrive.

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.900
Me?

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.530
I'll show you around, Princess Nadia.

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.280
Wait for me, Nadia!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.000
There!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.460
I can get in through that cave.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.010
What?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.100
My balloon!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.980
Do we have to mend it again?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:54.530
Jean!

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.450
Jean is safe!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.160
The balloon isn't broken either.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.700
He's telling us something.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.580
Stop!

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.330
He said "Stop!"

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.020
What are you going to do with me?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.480
We're going to take you to the Kingdom of Atlantis.

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:31.150
The Kingdom of Atlantis?

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.270
That's right.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:36.490
But that kingdom is in ruins. Nobody's supposed to be there.

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.860
No, you are to be there.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:45.040
Nadia is beyond this wall?

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:48.080
I saw the same thing in Gargoyle's base.

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.580
Nadia!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:54.040
Does that mean that Nadia was captured by Gargoyle?

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.340
No, I don't think this was made by Gargoyle.

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:58.470
Okay!

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:01.970
I'll break it!

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.390
Ou... Ouch!

00:11:08.390 --> 00:11:10.140
Listen, everybody.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.650
You all know this island is strange.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:19.320
Yes, but only roughly how strange.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:23.410
Right, a rough idea is good enough.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.490
We've been on this island for four months.

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:28.830
It's moving east-northeast

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.210
at a speed of one to ten kilometers a day.

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.290
It's impossible physically, but it's true.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:39.300
The speed has been increasing since yesterday.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:43.640
A totally new phenomenon is taking place now.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.640
We can't tell what will happen next.

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:48.350
It's beyond our knowledge.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:51.390
But if we can't rely on previous data,

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.350
how can you predict anything?

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.270
With intuition and imagination!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:01.530
There's enough data to excite my intuition and imagination.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:04.160
The sudden sinking of the eastern slope.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.030
The strange upheaval of the western sandhill.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:11.370
That strange luminous phenomenon in the sky.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.040
Anyway, the island shows a strange strain all over.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.920
Even a child could figure out what will happen next.

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.340
The whole island is listing to the east.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.180
If it keeps listing...

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.560
An earthquake just like the one before will happen again?

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:36.690
It will happen again, but worst of all this island...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:43.700
This island will sink into the sea.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:13:01.760
Open the suction valve. Remove all extraneous matter.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.470
Extraneous matter?

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.050
Trees and sand on the surface.

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:10.680
Wait! There are people on this island!

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:15.270
Red Noah is descending to a depth of 800 meters.

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:18.440
It is too late to stop it.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.320
There it goes!

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:49.970
Stop it! All of my friends are on this island!

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.270
Why do we have to sink into the sea?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.480
I don't want to go down there!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.900
You must become the ruler of Atlantis

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:06.320
in order to lead all souls toward its restoration.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:10.870
Why do we have to kill people in order to restore Atlantis?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.950
We're entering the critical stage.

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.210
Are you telling me to be the Devil?

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:18.080
You're no different than Gargoyle!

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.580
A high-level energy reading was observed.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:25.210
7 degrees 10 minutes north latitude,

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:29.390
62 minutes east longitude at zero hours 43 minutes.

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:32.220
Traveling at nineteen knots per hour.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:34.560
Red Noah...

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.190
The Holy Fortress Red Noah has started to move at last!

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:41.150
What are these?

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.780
My dresses, dishes, and cosmetics.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.610
Blankets, pillows and mats to sleep on.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.950
Food and water for a month.

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.120
Mine are just toys.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:59.000
This is too much for the Gratan to carry!

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.170
You'll have to leave some. Take only what you need.

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.340
What? You have to be kidding!

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.630
It's okay! I'll be getting off.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.010
Nadia is still on this island.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.180
I'm going to help her escape.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.140
You go ahead of us on the Gratan.

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:18.100
But you'll be sunk with the island if you stay.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:21.900
When I find Nadia, we'll get out of here on that boat.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:23.860
Jean...

00:15:24.230 --> 00:15:27.570
It's my duty to protect Nadia.
You understand?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.080
Hurry! You don't have much time left.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.500
Marie's going with you!

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.960
You must go with the others, Marie!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.420
No! Marie will escape with Nadia!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:51.380
You have King, Marie. You must protect him.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.090
But...

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.930
We'll see all of you in Africa.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.140
Jean!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.670
Jean... Nadia...

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:08.630
Let me out of here! I want to stay with my friends!

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:12.970
What is waiting for me in Atlantis?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.680
What can I do in a country where no one lives?

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.510
It's not fair to sink this island!

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:26.270
I don't want to sacrifice the lives of my friends!

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.940
We do not understand.

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:34.240
Why do you, Atlantis's heir, want to live with humans?

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.160
The restoration of the kingdom is our dream.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.740
You can accomplish this because you have inherited

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.290
the blood of Atlantis and the Blue Water.

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.210
No! Let me out of here!

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:48.130
There's someone waiting for me outside!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:51.800
Nadia...

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.480
I can get in from here!

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:12.110
I don't want to live here with you people.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:16.950
I want to decide my destiny for myself.

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:20.030
I'll change my fate by myself.

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:24.700
Your destiny as the natural heir of Atlantis?

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:29.710
Don't say that! I was born and grew up on this planet!

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:32.000
I only came to this island by accident!

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:37.970
Not by accident. Your Blue Water brought you here.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:40.640
This Blue Water has been responsible for everything.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.930
For people fighting and getting killed.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:46.060
It can't be helped.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:50.850
It is your fate as a descendant of Atlantis.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:54.440
A person's fate is not such a simple thing.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:57.860
I just want to go back to where I was born.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:02.370
If the Blue Water decides my fate, I'd rather not have it!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:42.490
Nadia!

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:44.280
Jean?

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:49.200
Is that Jean?

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:59.050
Jean!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.170
Jean...

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:02.180
Princess Nadia...

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:10.480
There is something more important to you

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.850
than the Blue Water?

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.320
What is it?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.610
Do you refuse even your fate for this thing?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.130
Come, Princess Nadia.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:44.630
I will take you to Tartessos where you were born.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:46.340
Tartessos?

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:49.510
The Blue Water will guide you there.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.770
Just follow it.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:57.560
However, you cannot escape your fate.

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.650
I shall see you again, Princess Nadia.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:13.620
The target has begun to submerge.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.130
It is in the Indian Ocean, headed west-southwest.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.550
What? Is it headed for Atlantis?

00:21:21.550 --> 00:21:24.880
Garfish 33 is pursuing it now.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:33.350
Nadia... Let's set out on the ocean together again.

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:36.440
Jean...

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.980
Nadia?

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.110
Don't open your eyes till I say okay.

00:21:42.110 --> 00:21:44.950
Nadia! Is that you, Nadia?

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.110
Please, close your eyes.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:56.080
Where are you, Nadia?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.330
Here.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.970
I knew you would come for me!

00:22:09.640 --> 00:22:10.220
Nadia...

00:22:14.350 --> 00:22:17.730
Let's get out of here quickly. It's sinking.

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:31.580
It's sunk so much!

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:33.740
Let's hurry, Nadia!

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:42.590
Nadia!

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:46.630
Nadia, hang in there!

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:47.630
Jean!

00:23:00.600 --> 00:23:01.770
The Gratan!

00:23:08.530 --> 00:23:10.860
That was a narrow escape.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:12.780
Thank you, everybody!

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:16.750
Don't worry about it! We're all friends here.

00:23:18.660 --> 00:23:21.290
Nadia! Nadia!

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:22.750
Marie!

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:27.340
King...

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.300
The island is sinking.

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:42.850
Goodbye, Red Noah.

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:44.810
Red Noah?

00:23:44.810 --> 00:23:46.230
That was the island's name.

00:23:46.230 --> 00:23:47.070
What's that?

00:23:49.610 --> 00:23:50.860
A Garfish!
